    "lyrics": {
      "text": "Now am I at rest, and have found__ great re-lease; for I have been trans-lat-ed from cor-rup-tion, and have passed o-ver in-to life. Lord, glo-ry be to__ Thee. \n\nNow have I chos-en the Maid-en Moth--er of God; for Christ,__ the Re-deem-er of all men, was born of her. Lord,__ glo-ry be to Thee.____"
